{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03897","headline":"从军行 · 崔融","name":"从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穹庐杂种乱金方，武将神兵下玉堂。\n天子旌旗过细柳，匈奴运数尽枯杨。\n关头落月横西岭，塞下凝云断北荒。\n漠漠边尘飞衆鸟，昏昏朔气聚羣羊。\n依稀蜀杖迷新竹，髣髴胡牀识故桑。\n临海旧来闻骠骑，寻河本自有中郎。\n坐看战壁爲平土，近待军营作破羌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}